    "_about": "THE BLACKBUCK (2026-11-05, 2nd pass): a compact, leggy antelope on the deer frame -- the back and flanks near black, the white underparts wrapping from between the forelegs along the belly and up the inside of the legs, a clean edge low on the flank; a thick short neck; a bold white ring round the eye, a white lip and chin; narrow ears; the spiralled horns kept SHARP PASS 2 (2026-11-08): the pointed parts -- horn, hornRidge (2 in all) -- are the engine's sharp `horn`s (sharp.js), made from the field shapes they replaced by tools/creaturegen/sharp/ (claws.py, teeth.py, spikes.py, antlers.py, bills.py): rooted in the body, tips pointed; RE-RUN those after this species' generator. (2026-11-08, ears2.py) The EARS (ears2.py): pointed LEAVES (sharp.js `fin`), paler in the hollow; the roots faired. (2026-11-08 evening, cervid.py) The tail sits on a DOCK (`tailDock`, a tube on the tail bone from inside the rump into the tail; the tail ell re-anchored onto it, as the chamois): it stood off the rump by a small gap.",
